  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "核心运行态（技术负责人一眼看）",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": { "h": 2, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 1 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**三问**：热盘口在不在动 · 写路径堵不堵 · 冷日线补到哪了。  \n**读法**：优先看本行六格颜色。A 股「停滞」在**休市/周末**属正常；币安几乎 7×24，长期「停滞」才要查。下方折叠区给排障深挖。"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "采集链路",
      "description": "collector + history-ingest 是否都在心跳（各贡献 1）。双活=2；半挂=1；全挂=0。若仍异常：docker compose ps collector history-ingest。",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 4, "x": 0, "y": 3 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(equitylab_collector_up) + sum(equitylab_history_ingest_up)",
          "legendFormat": "存活数",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "editorMode": "code",
          "exemplar": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 1 },
              { "color": "green", "value": 2 }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "range",
              "options": {
                "from": -0.5,
                "to": 0.5,
                "result": { "text": "全挂", "index": 0, "color": "red" }
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "range",
              "options": {
                "from": 0.5,
                "to": 1.5,
                "result": { "text": "半挂", "index": 1, "color": "yellow" }
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "range",
              "options": {
                "from": 1.5,
                "to": 2.5,
                "result": { "text": "双活", "index": 2, "color": "green" }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value",
        "justifyMode": "center"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "A 股采集",
      "description": "是否在拉 A 股报价。已跳过=排障开关 COLLECTOR_SKIP_CN_EQUITY=1，行情页会空，生产默认不应出现。",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 4, "x": 4, "y": 3 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [{ "expr": "equitylab_cn_equity_skip", "refId": "A" }],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "red", "value": 1 }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": { "text": "开着" },
                "1": { "text": "已跳过" }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "A 股盘口",
      "description": "最近 3 分钟内是否写过 A 股报价。在动=热路径通；停滞=盘中要查采集/写队列，休市停滞可忽略。",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 4, "x": 8, "y": 3 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "(time() - equitylab_quote_last_success_unixtime{market=\"cn_equity\"}) < 180",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "green", "value": 1 }
